  aciklama:
  - "Sevgili {{isim}}, fincan\u0131n\u0131n y\xFCksek k\u0131s\u0131mlar\u0131nda
    birbirine s\u0131k\u0131 s\u0131k\u0131ya ge\xE7mi\u015F ve uyum i\xE7inde \xE7al\u0131\u015Fan
    di\u015Fliler g\xF6r\xFCyorum. Bu \xE7arklar\u0131n \xFCzerinde ise bir \xE7ift
    g\xF6z var. Evlili\u011Finde her \u015Fey d\xF6rt d\xF6rtl\xFCk de\u011Fil, fark\u0131nday\u0131m.
    Daha iyi g\xFCnleriniz muhakkak olacak. Genele bakt\u0131\u011F\u0131m\u0131zda
    ise kayda de\u011Fer bir s\u0131k\u0131nt\u0131 g\xF6z\xFCkm\xFCyor. Sorun ne
    biliyor musun, bu gidi\u015Fat\u0131 yak\u0131ndan takip eden {{fiziki}} {{kelime,
    e\u015Finle ba\u011Flant\u0131l\u0131 | seninle ba\u011Flant\u0131l\u0131}} biri
    var. Sanki bu evlili\u011Fin aksamas\u0131n\u0131, sekteye u\u011Framas\u0131n\u0131
    bekler gibi. Tabloyu \xE7epe\xE7evre g\xF6rd\xFC\u011F\xFCm i\xE7in g\xF6n\xFCl
    rahatl\u0131\u011F\u0131 ile s\xF6yleyebilirim; daha \xE7ok bekler!..."
